			"name": "Heraldry",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Commissar is typically attached to a regiment not their own and must learn its customs quickly.\n\nDesign: IQ+0 (12) for 2 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum"
